WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.3 · Marketing & Communications
Messaging framework

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A messaging framework helps you and your co-founders describe the work the same way.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write a core message in one or two sentences.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Say what you will prove and when, not unseen outcomes.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Test messages with real people before you publish.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your core message, proof points and one audience version.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
